flowchart LR

IN["<b>② LISTENER</b> — everything collected today<br/><i>hundreds of threads, questions and posts</i>"]

G1{"<b>GATE 1 · RELEVANCE</b><br/>does it touch one of the<br/>8 ICPs' actual work?"}
G2{"<b>GATE 2 · SOURCEABILITY</b> ⭐<br/>is there a <b>checkable claim</b> in it?"}
G3{"<b>GATE 3 · LANE</b><br/>can one of the 7 people<br/>carry it in their own voice?"}
G4{"<b>GATE 4 · NOT REPEATED</b><br/>did we cover it in<br/>the last 30 days?"}

D1["🗑 <b>DROPPED</b><br/><i>no score computed —<br/>ranking things we cannot<br/>publish wastes the only<br/>expensive thing here</i>"]
D2["🗑 <b>DROPPED</b><br/><i>no claim → nothing for ⑤<br/>to verify → nothing we<br/>are allowed to say</i>"]
D3["🗑 DROPPED"]
D4["🗑 DROPPED"]

RANK["<b>③ RANK THE SURVIVORS</b> — four signals"]
R1["⭐ <b>DISAGREEMENT</b> — highest weight<br/><i>are two credible sources arguing<br/>about A NUMBER?</i>"]
R2["<b>VELOCITY</b><br/>mentions in 24h ÷ trailing<br/>7-day daily average<br/><b>>2.0 = accelerating</b>"]
R3["<b>BUYER DENSITY</b><br/><i>share of the conversation from<br/>ICP-shaped accounts, not<br/>the general public</i>"]
R4["<b>SEARCH INTENT</b><br/><b>CPC, never volume</b><br/><i>'secondary research' at $9<br/>is a student</i>"]
NOVOL["⛔ <b>RAW VOLUME IS NOT A SIGNAL</b><br/><i>a big conversation we cannot source<br/>is worth less than a small one we can</i>"]

WHY["⭐ <b>WHY DISAGREEMENT WINS</b><br/><i>a settled topic gives an analyst nothing to add.<br/>a disagreement is exactly what ⑤ returns as<br/><b>diverges</b> — and a diverges finding is the<br/>highest-travelling artefact the engine makes.<br/>the scorer HUNTS for it, in numbers not opinions</i>"]

CLAIM["<b>④ CLAIM READER</b><br/><i>turn the conversation into<br/>a checkable assertion + its basis</i>"]

VER{"<b>⑤ VERIFIER</b> — ask Caspr<br/><i>1 retrieve_analysis (free) →<br/>2 fact_lookup (cheap) →<br/>3 trigger_generation (billable,<br/>needs a human's name)</i>"}

V1["<b>confirmed</b><br/>it is true"]
V2["⭐ <b>diverges</b><br/>two sources disagree<br/>on the same basis"]
V3["<b>definitional</b><br/>they measure<br/>different things"]
V4["<b>no_data</b>"]

STOP["⛔ <b>NOTHING GOES OUT</b><br/><i>the model returns a refusal token<br/>instead of a draft. no source, no item.<br/><b>the refusal is a success, not an error</b></i>"]
OUTR["→ <b>㉑ OUTREACH</b><br/><i>a no_data claim can still carry<br/>a real distribution finding</i>"]

SPEED{"<b>⑥ HOW FAST DOES<br/>THIS NEED TO MOVE?</b>"}
VIRAL["🔥 <b>VIRAL / DAILY TRACK</b><br/>velocity high + confirmed/diverges<br/><i>3 a day, capped</i>"]
WEEK["📅 <b>WEEKLY TRACK</b><br/><i>deserves a full analysis</i>"]

IN --> G1
G1 -->|no| D1
G1 -->|yes| G2
G2 -->|no| D2
G2 -->|yes| G3
G3 -->|no| D3
G3 -->|yes| G4
G4 -->|"covered"| D4
G4 -->|"new"| RANK
RANK --> R1 & R2 & R3 & R4
NOVOL -.-> RANK
R1 -.-> WHY
R1 --> CLAIM
R2 --> CLAIM
R3 --> CLAIM
R4 --> CLAIM
CLAIM --> VER
VER --> V1 & V2 & V3 & V4
V4 --> STOP
V4 -.->|"if it carries a<br/>distribution finding"| OUTR
V1 --> SPEED
V2 --> SPEED
V3 --> SPEED
SPEED -->|"the conversation<br/>is happening NOW"| VIRAL
SPEED -->|"it will still<br/>matter in 2 weeks"| WEEK

classDef mach fill:#f5f4f2,stroke:#3c3c3a,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1a1a19
classDef hum fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#0d47a1
classDef stop fill:#37474f,stroke:#263238,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff
classDef warn fill:#fff8e1,stroke:#f9a825,stroke-width:2px,color:#7f5f00
classDef good fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px,color:#1b5e20
classDef drop fill:#eceff1,stroke:#90a4ae,stroke-width:1px,color:#455a64
class IN,RANK,R2,R3,R4,CLAIM,V1,V3 mach
class G1,G2,G3,G4,VER,SPEED hum
class STOP,NOVOL stop
class WHY,R1,V2,OUTR warn
class VIRAL,WEEK good
class D1,D2,D3,D4,V4 drop
